"US-0055: An action that failed to replay is kept after a real planning commit. In replayStep (src/main/planningSync.js) the path after a real commit marks every action in the cycle as committed, failed and clashed ones included, so pushStep drops them after the push. Only replayed actions may be marked committed; failed and clashed ones stay waiting with their reason, also after the push. Story in docs/features/epic-00-fixes.md."
